+@ Hän build: the ODDISH's move. The user hits itself (the move's target is the user): it takes the
+@ damage of a 40 power GRASS move, with no critical hit and no chance to miss. Then its SPEED
+@ falls, its SP. ATK rises sharply and it becomes confused, in that order.
+BattleScript_EffectOddishSmoke::
+	attackcanceler
+	attackstring
+	ppreduce
+	damagecalc
+	typecalc
+	adjustnormaldamage
+	attackanimation
+	waitanimation
+	effectivenesssound
+	hitanimation BS_TARGET
+	waitstate
+	healthbarupdate BS_TARGET
+	datahpupdate BS_TARGET
+	resultmessage
+	waitmessage B_WAIT_TIME_LONG
+	setmoveeffect MOVE_EFFECT_SPD_MINUS_1 | MOVE_EFFECT_AFFECTS_USER
+	seteffectprimary
+	jumpifhasnohp BS_ATTACKER, BattleScript_OddishSmokeEnd
+	setstatchanger STAT_SPATK, 6, FALSE @ six steps or more means: to the top. See ChangeStatBuffs
+	statbuffchange MOVE_EFFECT_AFFECTS_USER | STAT_CHANGE_ALLOW_PTR, BattleScript_OddishSmokeConfuse
+	jumpifbyte CMP_EQUAL, cMULTISTRING_CHOOSER, B_MSG_STAT_WONT_INCREASE, BattleScript_OddishSmokeConfuse
+	setgraphicalstatchangevalues
+	playanimation BS_ATTACKER, B_ANIM_STATS_CHANGE, sB_ANIM_ARG1
+	printfromtable gStatUpStringIds
+	waitmessage B_WAIT_TIME_LONG
+BattleScript_OddishSmokeConfuse::
+	bicbyte gMoveResultFlags, MOVE_RESULT_MISSED @ set when the stat was at the top already
+	setmoveeffect MOVE_EFFECT_CONFUSION | MOVE_EFFECT_AFFECTS_USER
+	seteffectprimary
+BattleScript_OddishSmokeEnd::
+	tryfaintmon BS_TARGET
+	goto BattleScript_MoveEnd
+
 BattleScript_MakeMoveMissed::
 	orbyte gMoveResultFlags, MOVE_RESULT_MISSED
 BattleScript_PrintMoveMissed::
