+// Hän build: the cheats on the title screen and the main menu (see main_menu.c).
+// A battle with CHAMPION JANE, or the twins' battle in the VIRIDIAN GYM, with the team from
+// GiveJaneCheatTeam. When it is over the game starts again from the top, so nothing that happened in it
+// reaches the save file.
+extern const u8 PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Defeat[];
